  "change": "Exact-source eval cache: each evaluator's entry runner retains successful, compiler-marked reusable compilations keyed by (entry shape, exact source text); a repeat skips parsing, lowering, literal abstraction and syntax keying and runs the retained entry with a fresh Script record. Direct eval, indirect eval and ShadowRealm evaluate only; Scripts reparse because global declaration admission reads the current global object; syntax errors, lowering errors, empty bodies and sole RegExp literals are never retained.",
  "commits": [
    "75164768 perf(eval): bound retained eval entries by literal-table size",
    "75137e9c test: cover eval source cache templates, functions, private names, failures and realms",
    "6de5a7d0 perf(eval): reuse compiled entries for repeated identical eval sources"
  ],
  "toolchains": {
    "base": "p-base base-toolchain-v147 (main 7099c5dc)",
